{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013iijXkKRYCZ4gDLH2USFho","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Cloudflare Workers nodejs_compat enabled by default compatibility date 2026 disable flag\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Compatibility flags · Cloudflare Workers docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/configuration/compatibility-flags/\"},{\"title\":\"Node.js compatibility · Cloudflare Workers docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/nodejs/\"},{\"title\":\"Node.js compatibility is now enabled by default · Changelog\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-08-04-nodejs-compat-default/\"},{\"title\":\"http · Cloudflare Workers docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/nodejs/http/\"},{\"title\":\"https · Cloudflare Workers docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/nodejs/https/\"},{\"title\":\"process · Cloudflare Workers docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/nodejs/process/\"},{\"title\":\"fs · Cloudflare Workers docs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/nodejs/fs/\"},{\"title\":\"More NPM packages on Cloudflare Workers: Combining polyfills and native code to support Node.js APIs\",\"url\":\"https://blog.cloudflare.com/more-npm-packages-on-cloudflare-workers-combining-polyfills-and-native-code/\"},{\"title\":\"Changelogs\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/37/\"},{\"title\":\"Workers Changelog\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/product/workers/10/\"}]\n\nCloudflare's docs say Node.js compatibility is on by default for newer compatibility dates, and you opt out with two no-flags.\n\n- **Default:** Workers now enable the nodejs_compat and nodejs_compat_v2 compatibility flags by default for compatibility dates of 2026-08-04 or later.\n- **Earlier dates:** For compatibility dates from 2024-09-23 through 2026-08-03, add the nodejs_compat compatibility flag to your Wrangler configuration file to opt in.\n- **Disabling:** For dates of 2026-08-04 or later, add both no_nodejs_compat and no_nodejs_compat_v2 after removing any positive flags. The changelog shows the same pattern, with \"compatibility_flags\": [\"no_nodejs_compat\", \"no_nodejs_compat_v2\"] in the config example.\n- **Existing projects:** Existing projects can update their compatibility date without removing them. Wrangler, Miniflare, the Cloudflare Vite plugin, and Vitest Pool Workers ignore these redundant flags when starting the runtime.\n\nThe search results don't document a `disable_nodejs_compat` flag. The documented opt-out is `no_nodejs_compat`, so check the exact spelling against the docs before relying on it.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"004e2442-10ea-487d-bd0e-3e245990653f","uuid":"7412b91d-7ecb-449e-97e7-7ebfc94dafc4","timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:12:49.154Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Cloudflare Workers nodejs_compat enabled by default compatibility date 2026 disable flag","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_017zvrj1fbMvoBqTSKnEjLVY","content":[{"title":"Compatibility flags · Cloudflare Workers docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/configuration/compatibility-flags/"},{"title":"Node.js compatibility · Cloudflare Workers docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/nodejs/"},{"title":"Node.js compatibility is now enabled by default · Changelog","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-08-04-nodejs-compat-default/"},{"title":"http · Cloudflare Workers docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/nodejs/http/"},{"title":"https · Cloudflare Workers docs","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/nodejs/https/"},{"title":"process · Cloudflare Workers docs"